Archive</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Office of Communication</collab></person-group><article-title>More broadband, more digital, more mobile &#x02013; a common picture of accelerating take-up of new products and services</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ofcom.org.uk/media/news/2005/07/nr_20050713"/></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keogh-Brown</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Wren-Lewis</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Edmunds</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Calculating the macroeconomic effects on the UK of an influenza pandemic (submitted)</article-title></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Information Centre for health and social care</collab></person-group><article-title>Sickness absence rates of NHS staff in 2004</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.dh.gov.uk/en/Publicationsandstatistics/Publications/PublicationsStatistics/DH_4112061"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>